<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:56Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>澳門國安首案宣判：區錦新囚12年半，妻子斥「莫須有迫害」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62yyejjrlro/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T06:19:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62yyejjrlro/trad--b441018db380.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62yyejjrlro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是澳門首宗國安案，案件過程並不公開，區錦新由「指派律師」辯護，審理法官及律師身份不明。從預審、開審到宣判，外界只能從政府新聞稿得知消息。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒勾結罪國安案：重判10年，料出獄已屆40歲</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynepe9578o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T16:26:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynepe9578o/trad--4b9007038e49.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynepe9578o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒原有望於數月內獲釋，但最新的10年判刑使他要繼續服刑到2036年，出獄時或已年屆40歲。法律學者分析，案件反映《香港國安法》或可被「反覆動用」，令特定政治犯持續留在獄中。</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩：北京為何區別處理「辱華」事件？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉後，AI放緩憂慮重創全球大型科技股，韓國股市熔斷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlyeen0z8x2o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T05:19:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlyeen0z8x2o/trad--9ff7f3b1ff8c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlyeen0z8x2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">市場正對美國期中選舉後可能加強審查數據中心建設及人工智慧產業的前景作出反應。</summary></entry><entry><title>「短睡眠基因」：為何有人只需睡四小時？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:53Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:59:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad--f832ffff66be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一般成年人平均需要七至九小時睡眠，但有些人確實只需極少睡眠也能維持良好狀態。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026年美國中期選舉結果實時更新</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T05:47:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad--72bb211f5d7d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國國會由眾議院和參議院組成。眾議院全部435個議席都會改選，眾議員任期固定為兩年。與此同時，參議院100個議席中，有35席亦會進行改選。參議員任期為六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉結果對中國和世界各國意味着什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckreyrxvg3xyo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T21:02:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckreyrxvg3xyo/trad--3e840ca95dca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckreyrxvg3xyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">民主黨在美國中期選舉中取得勝利，將在特朗普總統餘下的任期內掌控國會，標誌着美國政治格局出現重大變化。從烏克蘭和中東的衝突，到美國與中國的貿易關係，BBC記者分析這次選舉結果對世界其他地區意味着什麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>「這是一場災難」：中期選舉慘敗，共和黨內怒火指向特朗普</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5ynld35e3ro/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T02:36:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5ynld35e3ro/trad--6f391b89fee5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5ynld35e3ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些共和黨人告訴BBC，特朗普只顧自己的政治遺產，漠視選民關注的問題，令共和黨付出了代價。</summary></entry><entry><title>共和黨在美國中期選舉中慘敗的五大原因</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvrz6qrm2lo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T20:20:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvrz6qrm2lo/trad--0343139903cb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxyvrz6qrm2lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從選民的不滿情緒，到總統本人支持度低迷，本文分析為何傳統共和黨票倉的美國選民轉而支持民主黨。</summary></entry><entry><title>前央視節目主講人程萬軍在台尋求庇護未果 被送返泰國</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l36yzrq75o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T08:26:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l36yzrq75o/trad--26bf1b010848.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l36yzrq75o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">程萬軍隨後在網上發布影片，指控台灣執法人員在遣返過程中使用暴力。移民署則稱，他在登機時激烈抗拒並有自傷行為，執法人員為維護飛航安全採取必要措施。BBC中文無法獨立核實雙方的說法。</summary></entry><entry><title>他們在等西西弗斯：黃之鋒身後，那些寫信和探監的前戰友</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T05:03:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad--d738340ba645.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zxz94yzngpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控違反中國《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」罪，被判囚10年。BBC中文訪問了三位一直探望並寄信予黃之鋒的前戰友，了解他在獄中的變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美智庫解析「技術民族主義」下的中俄軍工合作細節與限度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad--3886ce690971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳APEC前夕，中俄「無上限」合有任何挑戰嗎？北京對烏克蘭停火興趣如何？在APEC中美俄三方領袖會面能有所突破？</summary></entry><entry><title>篤定成為首位穆斯林美國參議員，42歲的賽義德是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:14:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad--d191086536d0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在密歇根州，民主黨候選人阿卜杜勒·賽義德如今將成為美國首位穆斯林聯邦參議員。</summary></entry><entry><title>英王演說稱奴隸貿易是英國歷史「可恥的一章」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T07:06:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad--156f19761a90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">查爾斯三世在英聯邦政府首腦會議（CHOGM）發表這篇演說前，外界曾呼籲英國政府就英國在這項貿易中的歷史角色正式道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>《蘋果日報》前社長張劍虹提早獲釋，向官媒稱「好懊悔」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T03:05:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad--e78de854d205.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">除了張劍虹，據報至少還有3名因《香港國安法》入獄的人士，亦已提早獲釋。外界關注，壹傳媒創辦人黎智英能否同獲假釋機會。</summary></entry><entry><title>如果黑客能夠控制超市的冷凍櫃，其他科技設備又有多脆弱？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T05:50:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad--4347d59bab79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲多個國家的數十家商店遭到網絡攻擊，影響其冷藏設備。</summary></entry><entry><title>金與正發文 朝鮮否認策劃63億美元幣安黑客攻擊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T02:49:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad--c825027219b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國執法部門和網絡安全分析師將這宗破紀錄的盜竊案歸咎於平壤當局。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒涉「勾結外國勢力」被重判10年 出獄或已40歲</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:02:56Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:29:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad--f71843834735.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cjly00z2g03qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">上個月剛滿30歲的黃之鋒，自2020年底起因不同案件入獄，至今身在獄中超過六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我在橫店當王妃」：中國興起短劇體驗遊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:04:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad--2a7324d8d98f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">穿上古裝、化身皇帝或妃嬪，親自出演一場宮廷大戲。在中國「好萊塢」，遊客不再只是旁觀者，而是能過一把當主角的癮。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何美國中期選舉對特朗普至關重要？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T09:45:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad--342d128aa70c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國中期選舉將決定國會控制權歸屬，進而影響華盛頓未來兩年的權力格局。若民主黨奪回眾議院或參議院，可能制衡特朗普的施政議程。這場不見特朗普名字的選舉，卻可能深刻影響其總統任期後半程。</summary></entry><entry><title>姆巴佩的中國「烏龍」：毛澤東玩笑為何讓網民震怒？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T12:27:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad--79b75b230fe5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">為什麼名人和大型品牌經常觸碰到中國的政治紅線？這又反映出中國對全球商業世界具有多大的影響力？他們的道歉是否足以平息這場代價高昂的風波？</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平之後，中國將走向何方？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T09:28:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad--3e76c4ad96f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著習近平打破傳統任期慣例，未來的權力繼承路徑與接班陣容充滿變數。權力交接、接班人選，以及習近平未來角色的討論，正在成為中國政治最受關注、也最難回答的問題之一。習近平之後，中國會走向何方？</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉：四成陸配參選遭剔除，「法理死結」如何困住參政之路？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T04:37:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad--f1b3d90e30e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「除籍滿10年」如何計算，成為這屆選舉多位陸配被剔除參選資格的爭議焦點。今年有25位「陸配」參選，當中逾4成參選人不符參選資格。</summary></entry><entry><title>印尼有毒煙霾正令鄰國陷入政治難題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad--c5c9772ba0f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新加坡和馬來西亞政府正夾在焦慮不安的民眾與脾氣暴躁的鄰國之間。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國移民改革改什麼？BNO港人會受影響嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T11:37:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad--d987e7df47e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">內政大臣公布改革英國永久居留要求的計劃。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會「空椅子」背後：常態化高壓反腐如何改變官場？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T13:23:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad--eb04c414483a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「這次全會進一步表明，習近平的反腐運動沒有終點。」專家說，「持續施加紀律壓力不應只是階段性運動，而必須成為中共運作方式中永久存在的一部分。」</summary></entry><entry><title>Netflix 重現斯坦福監獄「虐待性」研究應該嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:21:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad--4c829f30fc85.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Netflix將美國心理學家菲利普·津巴多 (Philip Zimbardo) 1971 年備受爭議的研究改編成了一部六集真人秀，重新引發了一場由來已久的辯論，並引發了關於科學與娛樂之間界限的新問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>新北市長選戰：「政二代」還是「專業副手」能拿下關鍵一城？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T11:31:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad--d30d3a72b78c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為全台人口最多的直轄市，新北市被視為「最關鍵戰場」，將判定藍綠整體勝負，並可能牽動2028年總統大選。</summary></entry><entry><title>印中關係緩和之際：印邊境官員稱中國軍隊大批集結並搭帳篷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T00:23:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad--c22ccb93b383.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印中關係原本正處於謹慎的復甦階段，直到一位邊境官員的言論引發了人們對實際情況的新疑慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼歐洲各國年輕人走上街頭？背後的共同訴求和暴力隱憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T03:52:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad--af7f5220a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">過去一個月，歐洲各地爆發了由青年主導的示威遊行。這些遊行活動有何共同點？</summary></entry><entry><title>巴西前總統博索納羅之子敗給盧拉後，為何飛往美國？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T16:19:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad--c7ae9b4196f6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這位參議員離開巴西後，被拍到在美國走下飛機。他在巴西因涉嫌洗錢而接受調查。</summary></entry><entry><title>武契奇14年執政落幕，中塞「鐵桿友誼」何去何從？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T08:05:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad--bbb377741910.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從總理到總統，武契奇領導的塞爾維亞進步黨（SNS）一步步將塞爾維亞打造成歐洲強硬的親華國家，中國亦曾形容兩國關係為「鐵桿友誼 」。外界關注這一親華總統敗選，將如何改變中塞關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>愛情、幸運與魔法：年輕人為何找上了網上女巫？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad--dc4a3ec2e5b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一家網上零售商表示，他們有售有助帶來好運咒語，而最近購買的人數大幅上升。</summary></entry><entry><title>「見鬼了」：為什麼我們會產生超自然體驗？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-01T10:23:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad--39e1c5f76131.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人類講述鬼故事已有數千年歷史，科學的進步並未改變這一點。</summary></entry><entry><title>如何不刻意鍛煉，也能增加活動量？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T00:20:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad--2e35c9832285.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日常零星活動正顯現出保護健康的強大作用，其效果令人意外。它有助於我們消耗更多熱量，降低患心血管疾病的風險，甚至降低死亡風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼時候「豪華經濟艙」值得多花錢？來比較2026年全球五強</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T08:27:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad--c7b431e0bccb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球豪經艙排名出來，台灣長榮及阿聯酋航空分佔冠亞軍。</summary></entry><entry><title>觀鳥如何重塑大腦，延緩認知衰退？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-06T07:01:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T06:30:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad--bfe79e2154f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">觀鳥近年愈來愈受長者和認知障礙症患者歡迎。研究人員分析這項活動對他們的身心健康有何影響，以及可能帶來哪些益處。</summary></entry></feed>
